# Kind $72's flight (Kind72RideAlong, $83:F40D) out of the view, where it
# ends ($83:F483), which no play reaches: in cov_carpet_dive.box's play
# (its lines below) the rider flies off when Aladdin leaves the carpet,
# and the level ends about 40 frames on, before it is 160 pixels from the
# view (its in-view box, box 0 of $80:BA02; its range box $18 is 480).
# Eight frames into its flight its record ($097B) is put at y $0150, 208
# pixels below the view point (out of view, still in range): ActorsInView
# clears its $09 bit 6 and the flight ends.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a2_s1.state
wait 30
hold DOWN 120
hold DOWN+RIGHT 120
hold UP 60
hold DOWN+LEFT 120
wait 8
poke 00098A 50,01
wait 10
